# public/build IS committed. Normally build output does not belong in git, but
# this deploys through cPanel Git Version Control to a host with no Node, so the
# clone is what ships. Ignoring it meant every release needed a manual upload
# that nothing enforced, and a missing asset directory does not error - it
# renders the whole site unstyled.
#
# Rebuild with `php artisan view:clear && npm run build` (view:clear first, or
# stale compiled views keep ~26KB of dead CSS alive - deploy README 8.2) and
# commit the result as part of the release.
# /public/build
